<title>USA: Apple Computer shrs rise on earnings.</title>
<headline>Apple Computer shrs rise on earnings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Apple Computer Inc rose 1-1/4 to 28 after hours Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Apple reported earnings for the fourth quarter ended September 27 of $0.20 a share, compared to earnings of $0.48 a share the previous third quarter.</p>
<p>Apple had posted losses in its prior three quarters of this fiscal year.</p>
